BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 310.80 Tm (Start with four rights lanes: patent claims, brand identifiers, catalog works, and dataset permissions. They share a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 295.57 Tm (contract workflow but not a common ownership test. The patent lane requires an assignment chain, current legal status,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 280.35 Tm (territorial coverage, and a claim-to-product analysis; a patent license does not establish freedom to operate against other) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 265.12 Tm (owners. Under 35 U.S.C. 261, assignment documentation and timely recording matter, but a USPTO Assignment) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 249.90 Tm (Center entry does not independently prove the transferor owned everything conveyed. For catalog assets, 17 U.S.C. 204) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 234.67 Tm (generally requires a signed writing for a copyright ownership transfer. Purchasing source files or paying a freelancer) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 219.45 Tm (does not automatically convey copyright. Brand licenses need an enforceable quality-control program, not merely logo) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 204.22 Tm (delivery. Dataset access requires permission for the actual collection, processing, redistribution, and proposed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 189.00 Tm (downstream use; public availability alone does not supply those permissions. These are four separate beginner traps) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 173.77 Tm (with one circuit-breaker: no delivery until the rights register links each licensed asset to evidence, scope, owner, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 158.55 Tm (exceptions. The full-time principal owns that register; the rights contractor assembles evidence, and specialist counsel) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 143.32 Tm (resolves defects rather than allowing sales urgency to substitute for title.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 128.10 Tm (Scope defects often cost more than missing signatures because they surface after distribution. A music catalog can) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 112.87 Tm (contain separate composition, master-recording, performer, and artwork interests. A synchronization grant for one) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 97.65 Tm (recording does not clear every layer. A photograph license can still leave publicity or location restrictions unresolved.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 82.42 Tm (A dataset may include contributor terms allowing analytics but excluding model training, resale, or reidentification. A) Tj ET
