BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (inventory. A second trap is promising exclusive rights while retaining existing nonexclusive customers or lacking an) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (upstream exclusivity grant. A third is overlooking liens, prior grants, or termination rights that survive an acquisition.) Tj ET
