BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (or training-data slice can contaminate a large delivery.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (Build an evidence packet before negotiating a minimum guarantee. For patents, include signed assignments,) Tj ET
