BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 249.90 Tm (photographs, footage, and text because identical titles can conceal different rights holders. Dataset licensing starts with) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 234.67 Tm (collection provenance, source permissions, personal-data exposure, permitted transformations, and redistribution scope.) Tj ET
