BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 128.10 Tm (development. Their scopes must state response times, review limits, and who can substitute during a reporting deadline.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 112.87 Tm (Implement intake as a durable event pipeline, not a chain of unrecoverable spreadsheet edits. An HTTPS receiver) Tj ET
